    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea aba ng'asheesu seaniin ghaanung' gagaseadayi gurooroodeanyu; nea gideaba siida doabiiwaat, ea siida weaghoot, ea ng'asheega nyaawa sean sina, gwanda geatinga ASEETA; ada ea bariinyeega ghana ea sicheeda, siida mwanala. Aba heanyaawa ng'asheega sean marachi gil. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega sean gabussa sean nea gawuurji aba heeda siida doabiiwaat ea heeda siida mii doabiiwaat, aba heeda siida miy ea heeda siida muy, ea heeda fuga miyaasiin ea heeda fuga ririnnyeanda, ea fuga adayiida haleanjeeda ghadooweeda ea fuga meadayiida haleanjeeda ghadooweeda. Siida miy gooyang'deay sea siida riing'eeda, ea siida aga habeawooda ea siida awali agita habeawooda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nih ng'asheanda muy muuchi aba jeeda ng'asheega sisna aba hing'eadayda aseeta, aba gideaba gwasin sean ng'asheanjagi, ak gurooruunatka buuneeda ea ninyiit ng'asheega munyas, nea gwanda jeesinga gurooruunatka nyaawa geeska nea majeekcheewi nea iing'ata gaweay gheeda miyeeda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba gwanda raraweega aba heeda siida adeayi sea buuneesean majeekcheewi; (aba gideaba ghang'wana gudeeda majeek mwasamwa ng'adiida nimi); ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "aba gideaba fuga majeekcheewi ghwanal gideaba gaygameewa; nea fuga nimeewa ea manda ng'asheanda nal ak ea manda giimearda jea gabiikta ghwanyas; ak giipkeata nyaawa ea niroosa fih. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bariinyeega nyaawa ea sicheeda nyaawa, ea geawunyeeka gheanyanga nyaawa, nirooda sean; ak ea manda ginyaawa aba jeeda gida wasean ghayi sisin aba hing'eadayda aseeta.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ang'iing'i una heechea una, ak giyaagi hamitaang'u nea gihoosani, ak gileahi difaayeadaang'u nea gahoosan gurooroadaang'u; aba gideaba nimwas ASEETA gadiyoojigaagu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak ginung' gaweeriidi hang'weakaagu galeaga sean; ak ea adaghanyi ea manda uhuudaang'u nagheeda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gindeawi gatmooda ibwariinyi aba hooseaneega, aba jeeda eaweagaagu sean bea marachi gil, ghayi sigoonyi aba hing'eadayda aseeta; aba jeeda eawoojigaagu sean marachi gil, aba gideaba nih giteascheeweey gil aba jeeda eaweagaagu; ea aba jeeda sawanaduutkaagu ghayi igadiyeesi aba hing'eadayda aseeta. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea gida wasean sin geatindaang'u, gisini aba uurdaang'u aba gideaba manda gadiyeeda, ghana girgweageeda, ghana fughareeda, ghana weaghuumeeda, aba gheeda maloonghajeega iigali ang'iing'iin.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geabiikti dadaah aba hing'eadayda aseeta mii fuga ng'weeni gil gea adareamshachi aba ng'weega, ghana fuga meanyi gea jooriischi aba ng'ucheeda, nea mii fuga weaghoodi gil gea nyasa hamita, nea mii fuga mideawa fughareeda gil gea jea gabaruur, ghana fuga geariirji was gea jea ghwanyas alooheeda; nea damanda ea gheamamda muy gayghwanyas sean. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba eara siida mwanala damandaanyi; gawuurji ghweayeega ang'waay gheareedanga woosi, ak gawuurji dariidaka ang'waay ghuduumbwaada; ak gwasunu eara buuneeda geaghas aba damanda muy, ak gang'adeesa nea gwasham.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Iita weaghuumeeda ea leendeeda",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ata ghaadaayi weaghuumeeda uurji nih aba hing'eadayda aseeta, nea ng'asheanji aba heedeanyu iyeang'ulayi ea ng'asheanda hawi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ghayi gwanda mujiineani mwanang', nea gwanda jeeda fiisu ng'ay; ak ghwahidu sugoocheanda haw ak ghoang'waay, ak gooneaweesa hilgweanda majeek nea gagasa ghabwar. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak geedeaksa jeedida siyagi bwarbwar nea weaghoot, ak ghoaghu mujiineedida aba weaghuumeadaanyi; ak ea manda siida wassean apkaat siidida bwarbwariin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hean geayi, ghang'wana weaghuumeeda ea ghang'al uurda, nea weaghuumeeda siida bwarbwar geefool, nea eara ng'asheagaaschi ea meeleeysiina iit.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'asheega weaghoodiga sirugu nea geechiileesa gajeayiiy, ea ghang'al nyeashta siida haw ambal fuga dasheahi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "ECC 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Weaghuumeeda aamiy ea ghang'al dabita ng'ucheeda, nea siida riing'eeda iissa gwanuus ng'asheega saang'a miyaas.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
